IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `sg-companies-domain`

§ `Part 6 — Financial Statements and Audit`

-- ===========================================================================
-- Companies Act 1967 (Singapore), Part 6, ss 199–209A.
-- Source: SSO current version as at 07 Sep 2026.
--
-- Division 1: Financial Statements (ss 199–204)
-- Division 2: Audit (ss 205–209A)
-- ===========================================================================


§§ `Division 1 — Financial Statements`


§§§ `s 199 — Accounting records retention`

-- s 199(2): records must be retained >= 5 years from end of FY
@ref "Companies Act 1967, s 199(2)"
`accounting records retention years` MEANS 5


§§§ `s 201 — Financial statements to be laid before AGM`

-- s 201(9): audit must be completed >= 14 days before AGM
-- unless all persons entitled to notice unanimously agree to shorter period
@ref "Companies Act 1967, s 201(9)"
`audit completion days before AGM` MEANS 14

GIVEN `days before AGM audit completed`  IS A NUMBER
    , `unanimous consent to shorter period` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `audit timing requirement met` IF
    `days before AGM audit completed` AT LEAST 14
    OR `unanimous consent to shorter period`


§§§ `s 201A — Dormant company exemption from financial statements`

-- s 201A(1): exemption conditions
-- (a) dormant — no accounting transaction during FY
-- (b) total assets never exceed $500,000 during FY
-- (c) no override notice from Registrar, members >= 5% shares, or >= 5% of members
-- Override notice must arrive >= 3 months before FY end
@ref "Companies Act 1967, s 201A(1)"
GIVEN `is dormant`                        IS A BOOLEAN
    , `total assets exceeded 500000`      IS A BOOLEAN
    , `override notice received`          IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `exempt from preparing financial statements` IF
        `is dormant`
    AND NOT `total assets exceeded 500000`
    AND NOT `override notice received`

-- s 201A(1): total assets threshold
@ref "Companies Act 1967, s 201A(1)"
`dormant company asset threshold` MEANS 500000

-- s 201A(1)(c): override notice deadline
@ref "Companies Act 1967, s 201A(1)(c)"
`override notice months before FY end` MEANS 3

-- s 201A(1)(c): who may send override notice
@ref "Companies Act 1967, s 201A(1)(c)"
GIVEN `is Registrar`                      IS A BOOLEAN
    , `percentage of shares held`         IS A NUMBER
    , `percentage of total members`       IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may send dormant company override notice` IF
        `is Registrar`
    OR  `percentage of shares held` AT LEAST 5
    OR  `percentage of total members` AT LEAST 5


§§§ `s 201B — Audit committee for listed companies`

-- s 201B(2): minimum 3 members, majority non-executive
@ref "Companies Act 1967, s 201B(2)"
GIVEN `audit committee members`      IS A NUMBER
    , `non executive members`        IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `audit committee properly constituted` IF
        `audit committee members` AT LEAST 3
    AND `non executive members` GREATER THAN (`audit committee members` DIVIDED BY 2)

-- s 201B(4): replacement deadline if below minimum
@ref "Companies Act 1967, s 201B(4)"
`audit committee replacement months` MEANS 3


§§§ `s 203 — Dispatch of financial statements`

-- s 203(1): two-branch deadline
-- If AGM required: >= 14 days before AGM
-- If no AGM (s 175A): within 5 months after FY end
@ref "Companies Act 1967, s 203(1)"
GIVEN `AGM required` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `financial statements dispatch deadline` IS
    IF `AGM required`
    THEN 14   -- days before AGM
    ELSE 150  -- ~5 months (days) after FY end

-- s 203(1): days before AGM
@ref "Companies Act 1967, s 203(1)"
`dispatch days before AGM` MEANS 14

-- s 203(1): months after FY end if no AGM
@ref "Companies Act 1967, s 203(1)"
`dispatch months after FY end if no AGM` MEANS 5


§§ `Division 2 — Audit`


§§§ `s 205 — Auditor appointment`

-- s 205(1): directors must appoint within 3 months of incorporation
@ref "Companies Act 1967, s 205(1)"
`auditor appointment months after incorporation` MEANS 3

-- s 205(11): nomination at AGM requires >= 21 days notice
@ref "Companies Act 1967, s 205(11)"
`auditor nomination notice days` MEANS 21

-- s 205(11): company must circulate nomination >= 7 days before meeting
@ref "Companies Act 1967, s 205(11)"
`auditor nomination circulation days before meeting` MEANS 7


§§§ `s 205AF — Post-resignation auditor replacement`

-- s 205AF(1)(c): convene meeting within 3 months of resignation
@ref "Companies Act 1967, s 205AF(1)(c)"
`auditor replacement meeting months` MEANS 3


§§§ `s 205B — Dormant company audit exemption`

-- s 205B(1): exempt if dormant from formation or since end of previous FY
-- s 205B(3): member override — >= 5% shares or >= 5% members, by notice
-- not later than 1 month before FY end
@ref "Companies Act 1967, s 205B(1),(3)"
GIVEN `dormant from formation or since previous FY end` IS A BOOLEAN
    , `member override notice received`                 IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `exempt from audit as dormant company` IF
    `dormant from formation or since previous FY end`
    AND NOT `member override notice received`

-- s 205B(3): member override notice deadline
@ref "Companies Act 1967, s 205B(3)"
`dormant audit override notice months before FY end` MEANS 1


§§§ `s 205C — Small company audit exemption`

-- s 205C + Thirteenth Schedule: exempt if "small company"
-- Small company: satisfies >= 2 of 3 criteria in each of 2 consecutive
-- preceding FYs:
--   (a) annual revenue <= $10M
--   (b) total assets <= $10M
--   (c) employees <= 50
-- For groups: group must also qualify as "small group" (same tests consolidated)
@ref "Companies Act 1967, s 205C, Thirteenth Schedule"

`small company revenue threshold` MEANS 10000000
`small company asset threshold` MEANS 10000000
`small company employee threshold` MEANS 50

GIVEN `annual revenue`  IS A NUMBER
    , `total assets`    IS A NUMBER
    , `employees`       IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `small company criteria met` IS
    (IF `annual revenue` AT MOST 10000000 THEN 1 ELSE 0)
    PLUS (IF `total assets` AT MOST 10000000 THEN 1 ELSE 0)
    PLUS (IF `employees` AT MOST 50 THEN 1 ELSE 0)

-- Qualifies as small in a single year if >= 2 of 3 criteria met
GIVEN `annual revenue`  IS A NUMBER
    , `total assets`    IS A NUMBER
    , `employees`       IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `qualifies as small company in year` IF
    (`small company criteria met` `annual revenue` `total assets` `employees`)
        AT LEAST 2

-- Full qualification requires both preceding FYs
GIVEN `qualifies year 1` IS A BOOLEAN
    , `qualifies year 2` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `qualifies as small company` IF
    `qualifies year 1` AND `qualifies year 2`

-- Group-level test: same criteria at consolidated level
GIVEN `group qualifies year 1` IS A BOOLEAN
    , `group qualifies year 2` IS A BOOLEAN
    , `company qualifies`      IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `small company audit exemption applies` IF
        `company qualifies`
    AND `group qualifies year 1`
    AND `group qualifies year 2`


§§§ `s 207 — Mandatory fraud reporting`

-- s 207(9D): auditor must report if offence punishable >= 2 years imprisonment
-- AND property obtained/obtainable >= $100,000
@ref "Companies Act 1967, s 207(9D)"
GIVEN `offence imprisonment years`   IS A NUMBER
    , `property value`               IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `mandatory fraud reporting triggered` IF
        `offence imprisonment years` AT LEAST 2
    AND `property value` AT LEAST 100000

-- s 207(9D): thresholds
@ref "Companies Act 1967, s 207(9D)"
`fraud reporting imprisonment threshold years` MEANS 2
`fraud reporting property threshold` MEANS 100000


